# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Power BI source artefacts — never published.
#
# The site is screenshots and writing. The model, the DAX and the report
# definition stay on disk. This list is the safety net: it makes a careless
# `git add .` a no-op rather than a leak.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pbix
*.pbit
*.pbip
*.pbids
*.pbidataset
*.pbir
*.pbiviz
*.tmdl
*.bim
*.dax

# PBIP folder layouts (any depth)
**/*.Report/
**/*.SemanticModel/
**/*.Dataset/
**/.pbi/
**/definition/
**/StaticResources/

# Data
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.json.gz
*.sqlite
*.db

# Credentials and connection details
*.env
.env*
appsettings*.json
*.pubxml
*.publishsettings
secrets*

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
*.tmp
